# Cell from playpick: mode=battleground map=escort spec=shaman:elemental
# style=melee view=820x1180,touch save=carried.
#
# The Long Haul (escort) has seen dodge twice (shaman:elemental 2026-09-25-26,
# warlock:destruction 2026-09-25-...6) but never melee. melee has been run on
# a battleground exactly once before, on Ebb and Flow with a marksmanship
# hunter (390x844) -- a ranged spec forced into melee range, which read
# hitsPerMin=0 the whole match. Elemental shaman is also a ranged caster, so
# this repeats that mismatch on a new map and asks whether the cart-following
# nature of escort (the fight follows the cart rather than sitting on a fixed
# point) changes anything about a body that beelines the nearest enemy
# regardless of range. carried save is known-fresh-in-disguise per #273
# (still open), so nothing here relies on anything actually carrying.
open
targets
shot front

tap battleground
targets
shot bg-menu

tap map:escort
targets
shot escort-picked

tap class:shaman:elemental
shot class-picked

tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
shot pulled
state
targets

play melee 90
shot mid1
state
bill

wait 5
play melee 90
shot mid2
state
bill

wait 5
play melee 90
shot mid3
state
bill
says
targets
